		"description": "EchoGPT backend API. Set baseUrl (default http://localhost:3000). Run Register, then Login (tokens are saved automatically), then work through the folders top to bottom. For the admin folder, promote an account to ADMIN in the database and log in again. Replace YOUR_PROVIDER_API_KEY with a real provider key before testing Chat and Search.",
